InvertingInput|COMP_INVERTINGINPUT_VREFINT|VREFINT connected to comparator 2 inverting input
InvertingInput|COMP_INVERTINGINPUT_3_4VREFINT|3/4 VREFINT connected to comparator 2 inverting input
InvertingInput|COMP_INVERTINGINPUT_1_2VREFINT|1/2 VREFINT connected to comparator 2 inverting input
InvertingInput|COMP_INVERTINGINPUT_1_4VREFINT|1/4 VREFINT connected to comparator 2 inverting input
InvertingInput|COMP_INVERTINGINPUT_DAC1|DAC_OUT1 (PA4) connected to comparator 2 inverting input
InvertingInput|COMP_INVERTINGINPUT_DAC2|DAC2_OUT (PA5) connected to comparator 2 inverting input
